OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey and damp start across
OL,6,Fthe region with light rain through the
OL,7,Fmorning. The rain clears to the
OL,8,Fsoutheast by early afternoon to leave
OL,9,Fthe rest of the day partly cloudy and
OL,10,Fdry. Feeling warm later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy and dry through
OL,13,Fthe evening with clear spells
OL,14,Flengthening overnight leading to a
OL,15,Fmuch cooler, fresher feeling night.
OL,16,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
