OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FFine and dry initially. Cloud
OL,6,Fbuilds through the afternoon with some
OL,7,Fpatchy light rain through the late
OL,8,Fafternoon and evening. Winds freshen
OL,9,Fthrough the day. Near average
OL,10,Ftemperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FRemaining cloudy with further light
OL,14,Frain at times through Saturday and
OL,15,FSunday. Fresh winds and temperatures
OL,16,Fbecoming warmer. Drier and brighter on
OL,17,FMonday, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
